Governments don't HAVE to be the same way, it isn't written in stone that they have to bow down to the interests of corporations every chance they get. Politicians give every large company a pass because they make money doing it. People making the decisions and/or making the money off of these decisions CAN be held responsible, they just won't be because, more times than not, the people doing the legislation are making money off of things as they stand.  

These types of things will keep happening until we have a government that isn't run by the same people who stand to profit from these kinds of behaviors and the corporations that do the evil shit they do in the name of profit-seeking are punished in ways they will actually feel.

